# Line endings for a Python repository worked on from Windows and Linux.
# With this file, git stores text with LF and core.autocrlf no longer
# decides. Adding it to an existing repository is its own commit, with
# `git add --renormalize .` (see core/clean-up.md), and only when asked.
* text=auto
*.py text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.whl binary
